    "sub_name": "精算實務與軟體(一)",
    "sub_ename": "ACTUARIAL PRACTICE AND SOFTWARE (1)",
    "describe_ch": "學習使用EXCEL VBA，並運用於精算基礎模型，課程內容包括： 死亡率模型、 保費計算、 準備金、 退休金計畫與給付。連結的課程： 壽險數學、退休金數學。\n\n",
    "describe_eh": "The main goals of this class is to learn the operation of EXCEL VBA and apply it to basic actuarial models, including：\n1. Mortality Models\n2. Premium Calculation\n3. Reserves\n4. Pension Plan and Retirement Benefits\nThe linked courses：\n1. Mathematics for Life Insurance\n2. Pension Mathematics\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
